{"header":"<h1>Module <code><span>Clock.Mono</span></code></h1>","type":"documentation","uses_katex":false,"breadcrumbs":[{"name":"Index","href":"../../../../index.html","kind":"leaf-page"},{"name":"eio","href":"../../../index.html","kind":"page"},{"name":"Eio_mock","href":"../../index.html","kind":"module"},{"name":"Clock","href":"../index.html","kind":"module"},{"name":"Mono","href":"#","kind":"module"}],"toc":[],"source_anchor":null,"preamble":"","content":"<div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec type anchored\" id=\"type-t\"><a href=\"#type-t\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">type</span> t</span><span> = <span><span><span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Mtime</span>.t <a href=\"../index.html#type-ty\">ty</a></span> <a href=\"../../../Eio/Std/index.html#type-r\">Eio.Std.r</a></span></span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-make\"><a href=\"#val-make\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> make : <span>unit <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <a href=\"#type-t\">t</a></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>make ()</code> is a new clock.</p><p>The time is initially set to 0.0 and doesn't change except when you call <a href=\"#val-advance\"><code>advance</code></a> or <a href=\"#val-set_time\"><code>set_time</code></a>.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-advance\"><a href=\"#val-advance\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> advance : <span><a href=\"#type-t\">t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> unit</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>advance t</code> sets the time to the next scheduled event (adding any due fibers to the run queue).</p><ul class=\"at-tags\"><li class=\"raises\"><span class=\"at-tag\">raises</span> <code>Invalid_argument</code> <p>if nothing is scheduled.</p></li></ul></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-try_advance\"><a href=\"#val-try_advance\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> try_advance : <span><a href=\"#type-t\">t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> bool</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>Like <a href=\"#val-advance\"><code>advance</code></a>, but returns <code>false</code> instead of raising an exception.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-set_time\"><a href=\"#val-set_time\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> set_time : <span><a href=\"#type-t\">t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Mtime</span>.t <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> unit</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>set_time t time</code> sets the time to <code>time</code> (adding any due fibers to the run queue).</p></div></div>"}